<back><div type="verses">
<lg label="2."><l>Grace that was prophesied in ancient times,</l><l>The Spirit has made clear;</l><l>Christ’s all-sufficient, unlimited grace</l><l>Is to our hearts so dear.</l></lg>
<lg label="3."><l>The grace of life to the saints, strong and weak,</l><l>Is God as life supplied;</l><l>His divine Trinity flowing is grace,</l><l>Christ in us magnified.</l></lg>
<lg label="4."><l>The varied grace of God, riches of life,</l><l>Ministered by the saints,</l><l>Conveys the gracious, sweet words of Christ</l><l>With strength which never faints.</l></lg>
<lg label="5."><l>Grace to the humble the Grace-giver gives,</l><l>But He resists the proud;</l><l>Cast all your cares and fears onto God,</l><l>No worry to allow.</l></lg>
<lg label="6."><l>The God of all grace, the true grace of God,</l><l>In God’s economy,</l><l>Consummates into the City of Grace,</l><l>Grace in eternity.</l></lg>
</div>
</back>
</music></mei>
